{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411210","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1441121001:1":{"text":"오, 이 뜨거운 공기! 맹렬한 불길!","source_cn":"嚯！这火热的空气，这欢快的烈焰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDDB261C76C14F44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441121002:1":{"text":"이 용암 속 폐허가 바로 드워프들의 옛 고향이구나.","source_cn":"这熔岩里的废墟就是矮人的故土……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1D2727954F52E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441121003:1":{"text":"헥토르 님, 드워프, 드래곤... 모두 얽히고설킨 이야기들이 다 여기서 일어났던 건가?","source_cn":"赫托，矮人，龙……那么多纠葛就是在这儿上演的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4011A9C0EB14F4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441121004:1":{"text":"왠지 모든 게 끝을 향해 나아가고 있다는 느낌이 들어.","source_cn":"我有种一切终于要结束的预感！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028C64FCE7F6EB7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}